<title>UK: UK grain futures close mixed but direction unsure.</title>
<headline>UK grain futures close mixed but direction unsure.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-10-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>UK grain futures closed mixed with the short-term direction unsure following continued currency gyrations from sterling versus a number of currencies.</p>
<p>Wheat futures finished 0.15 sterling up to 0.70 down after trading 742 lots, while barley ended 0.25 sterling above Thursday's finish. Barley traded 29 lots.</p>
<p>Amsterdam wheat futures was again ignored.</p>
<p>--London Newsroom +44 171 542 8074</p>
